{"v":1,"st":"NV","e":"2020-11-03","src":{"carson-city-summary":["Carson City Clerk-Recorder: Election Summary Report, General Election, November 3, 2020","https://www.carsoncity.gov/home/showpublisheddocument/73328/637411337643770000","official",1,"2026-10-23","3fa219d09c2be0a477fafee488cb88b47fa4a23fe95f8aec43353ca90f84e3b9",0],"clark-official":["Clark County Election Department: 20G Official Election Results","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx","official",1,"2026-10-23","475b81cb973eaca1ec96425592a160b1a44aa7371ff50912ea2b8c56281b558f",1],"clerk-statistics":["Office of the Clerk, U.S. House of Representatives: Statistics of the Presidential and Congressional Election of November 3, 2020","https://clerk.house.gov/member_info/electionInfo/2020/statistics2020.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-16","666b2a1f673f263087c141c4d44b0dce47cbddc8f4df27fbc8b415cf05842b76",2],"douglas-summary":["Douglas County Clerk-Treasurer: Official Summary Report, Final Results, General Election, November 3, 2020","https://cltr.douglascountynv.gov/UserFiles/Servers/Server_18102038/File/Elections/WebResults/2020/GE/Official%20Summary%20Report_Final%20Results.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-23","eb294f63aad1bd9dfa067c097e3dd086175376031d7fbf91384680f219ba2104",3]},"notes":["Headed 'CARSON CITY, NEVADA OFFICIAL RESULTS', 'Election Summary - 11/13/2020'.","The county's results page with this election and 'OFFICIAL ELECTION RESULTS' chosen: each contest's county figures and its 'VOTE FOR' count; the page bolds the leading names. It prints no party.","Compiled by the Clerk from official sources; Nevada's section on page 45 of the PDF. Read for the federal contests' statewide figures (the control) and winners. The copy on this computer was saved by another state's loader (states_cache/al_local/clerk_statistics2020.pdf).","Headed 'Offical Results' (so spelt; 11/13/2020). Pages read: 1 to 8 of the PDF; the report prints 'Offical Results' (11/13/2020 8:36:18 AM)."],"gaps":[["county","Clark County: small precincts' figures","Clark County's Statement of Vote prints '*' in place of the figures of a precinct with too few voters to keep a ballot secret; those precinct cells are not stored, and the county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["county","Clark County: 8,086 precinct figures by kind of vote whose total is hidden","The county hides each kind of vote (Election Day, Early Vote, Mail) and the precinct's total on their own; where a precinct's total for a choice is hidden ('*') but one or more of its kinds is printed (often a 0 for mail), those printed kinds are left out too, since a precinct's figures by kind of vote are stored only beside its total. The county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["state","The Secretary of State's statewide canvass","The Secretary of State's results sites (www.nvsos.gov, silverstateelection.nv.gov) answer programs with an Incapsula bot wall, so the statewide canvass (every county's figures for the statewide, multi-county and federal contests) is not read; John can save it in his own browser.","https://www.nvsos.gov/sos/elections/election-information/2020-election-information"],["county","Washoe County","Washoe County's website (www.washoecounty.gov) served this computer normally on 2026-10-01, but from 2026-10-23 its web firewall answers every request with an empty 404, so it is not asked; the county's past-results pages can be saved in John's own browser.","https://www.washoecounty.gov/voters/reporting_and_data/past-election-information/electionresults/2020generalelectionresults.php"],["county","Churchill County","Churchill County posts this election's summary headed 'UNOFFICIAL FINAL' and a statement of votes cast by precinct whose layout this loader does not read yet.","https://www.churchillcountynv.gov/Archive.aspx?AMID=85"],["county","Elko County","Elko County's canvass is a scanned document with no text layer.","https://elkocountynv.gov/departments/clerk/2024/2020%20General%20Canvass%20and%20Abstract%20of%20the%20Vote.pdf"],["county","Esmeralda County","No website of Esmeralda County's with election results was found.",""],["county","Eureka County","No 2020 results document was found on Eureka County's website.","https://www.eurekacountynv.gov/departments/clerk-recorder/elections/"],["county","Humboldt County","No 2020 results document was found on Humboldt County's website.","https://www.humboldtcountynv.gov/317/Elections"],["county","Lander County","No 2020 results document was found on Lander County's website.","https://www.landercountynv.org/government/clerk/election_information.php"],["county","Lincoln County","No results document was found on Lincoln County's website.","https://lincolncountynv.org/departments/clerks-office/elections/"],["county","Lyon County","Lyon County's 2020 abstract is scanned pages with no text layer.","https://www.lyon-county.org/DocumentCenter/View/11297/2020-GENERAL-ELECTION-ABSTRACT"],["county","Mineral County","No results document was found on Mineral County's website.","https://mineralcountynv.us/government/clerk_treasurer/election.php"],["county","Nye County","Nye County's posted results are scanned pages with no text layer.","https://www.nyecountynv.gov/DocumentCenter/View/37739/2020-General-Election-Results-PDF"],["county","Pershing County","No 2020 results document was found on Pershing County's website.","https://www.pershingcountynv.gov/government/clerk-treasurer/elections.php"],["county","Storey County","No 2020 results document was found on Storey County's website.","https://www.storeycounty.org/208/Election-Information"],["county","White Pine County","White Pine County's canvass is a scanned document with no text layer.","https://www.whitepinecounty.net/659/2020-Election"]],"chk":{"n":22,"ok":22,"not":[]},"cty":{"32003":"Clark County","32005":"Douglas County","32510":"Carson City"},"